.TH STEAM-LIBRARY-MOVER 1 "2026" "steam-library-mover @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
steam-library-mover \- move installed Steam games between libraries safely
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B steam-library-mover
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B steam-library-mover-cli
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B steam-library-mover
is a Qt/KDE desktop application that moves an installed Steam game from one
registered Steam library to another without using Steam's own
\(lqMove install folder\(rq operation.
.PP
Steam must be completely closed while a move runs. The mover copies and
verifies the payload, prefix, shader cache and Workshop data, atomically writes
the destination manifest and updates the existing game entries in
.B libraryfolders.vdf
with a backup. Every operation is journaled under
.I ~/.local/state/steam-library-mover/
so it can be inspected or rolled back with the Recovery dialog.
.PP
The application never creates or registers a new Steam library and never adds
drive entries to Steam's database.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version.
.TP
.BI \-\-steam-root " path"
Use an explicit Steam installation root.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit machine-readable JSON where supported.
.TP
.BI \-\-appid " id"
Steam application id for \fBplan\fP or \fBmove\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-to " path"
Destination Steam library path.
.TP
.B \-\-dry-run
Plan without modifying files.
.TP
.B \-\-yes
Confirm a move or \fBhealth \-\-apply\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-verify " quick|full"
Verification mode.
.TP
.B \-\-no-shadercache
Do not move shader cache.
.TP
.B \-\-no-workshop
Do not move Workshop content and its manifest.
.TP
.B \-\-allow-ntfs
Acknowledge Windows-filesystem risks, including native Linux games.
.TP
.B \-\-quit-steam
Ask the selected Steam client to shut down before planning.
.TP
.B \-\-keep-source
Register the game at the destination but leave the source payload, prefix,
shader cache and Workshop data in hidden
.B .slm-backup-*
folders. Source space is not freed until those folders are removed manually.
.TP
.BI \-\-library " path"
Steam library path for \fBdoctor\fP or \fBfix-compatdata\fP.
.TP
.B \-\-apply
Apply doctor changes, or quarantine safe lock/temp files for \fBhealth\fP.
.TP
.B \-\-list
List unfinished operations for \fBrecover\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-rollback " opid"
Roll back an unfinished operation.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List libraries and installed applications.
.TP
.B plan
Build a move plan and show blockers and the storage projection without
modifying anything.
.TP
.B move
Execute a planned move. Requires \fB\-\-yes\fP.
.TP
.B health
Scan for stale lock files, stale manifest temporary files, orphaned game
folders, prefixes, shader cache and Workshop data, duplicate appids, broken
compatdata links and source backups. With \fB\-\-apply \-\-yes\fP, quarantine
safe lock/temp files into hidden
.B .slm-quarantine
folders. Quarantine renames, never deletes, and is refused while Steam or a
Proton/Wine game is running.
.TP
.B doctor
Inspect NTFS/exFAT compatibility and Proton prefix placement.
.TP
.B fix-compatdata
Configure a compatdata symlink for an NTFS library.
.TP
.B recover
List or roll back unfinished operations.
.SH GUI
The desktop application adds:
.IP \(bu 2
friendly drive names with full paths on hover;
.IP \(bu 2
storage usage bars and batch free-space projections;
.IP \(bu 2
multi-select batch moves and drag-and-drop onto a library;
.IP \(bu 2
pause/resume and cancel-queue controls;
.IP \(bu 2
Proton/Native detection, compat-tool version, last played, build ID and size
breakdown;
.IP \(bu 2
Ready/Blocked/Warnings/Proton/Native/Auto filters and sorting;
.IP \(bu 2
Library Health with safe quarantine of stale lock/temp files;
.IP \(bu 2
System, Light and Dark themes;
.IP \(bu 2
sleep inhibition, desktop completion notifications and an optional Start Steam
action.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SLM_STEAM_ROOT
Override the detected Steam root.
.TP
.B SLM_STATE_DIR
Directory for journals, logs and backup metadata.
.TP
.B SLM_CACHE_DIR
Directory for the display-only startup scan cache.
.TP
.B SLM_ARTWORK_DIR
Local box-art cache directory.
.TP
.B SLM_DISABLE_ARTWORK
Disable artwork fetching.
.TP
.B SLM_THEME
Force \fBsystem\fP, \fBlight\fP or \fBdark\fP for the current run.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/steam-library-mover/
Journals, logs, backups and quarantine metadata.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/steam-library-mover/artwork/
Cached box art.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR steam (1)
.PP
Project documentation: README.md, docs/SAFETY.md, docs/NTFS.md and
docs/TESTING.md.
